{"unit_id":"lanxiuyun__dsh-multi-chat#card-zh","repo":"lanxiuyun/dsh-multi-chat","commit":"8a7a96287c99dd3358d45301d732dace8e273dd6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-chat（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH Web 会话区把多个实时对话并排显示为等宽网格。它接入会话主区域和侧边栏会话行，用户可从侧边栏加入会话面板，并在面板中查看各自的对话与输入区。主要功能包括拖动面板排序、关闭多余面板、突出显示当前活动会话、只保留当前面板，以及设置同时打开的面板上限；默认上限为六个，最高九个。用户也可从工具栏或插件设置卡片关闭网格，恢复单会话视图。适合需要在桌面浏览器中同时比较或跟进多个 DSH 对话的用户；插件不需要额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1776-1850","lib/client.js:2102-2175"]}
{"unit_id":"lanxiuyun__dsh-multi-chat#card-en","repo":"lanxiuyun/dsh-multi-chat","commit":"8a7a96287c99dd3358d45301d732dace8e273dd6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-multi-chat is a DSH web plugin for viewing live conversations side by side. Add sessions from the sidebar, reorder or close panes, and highlight the active chat. The grid supports up to nine panes and can be disabled in settings. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1776-1850","lib/client.js:2102-2175"]}
