{"unit_id":"lanxiuyun__dsh-multi-chat#feature-1","repo":"lanxiuyun/dsh-multi-chat","commit":"8a7a96287c99dd3358d45301d732dace8e273dd6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-chat 的功能「多会话网格」：在 DSH Web 会话区并排呈现已打开的对话；点击侧边栏会话可加入面板，每个面板保留自己的会话内容。 通过会话侧边栏、面板控件或设置卡片操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2102-2130"]}
{"unit_id":"lanxiuyun__dsh-multi-chat#feature-2","repo":"lanxiuyun/dsh-multi-chat","commit":"8a7a96287c99dd3358d45301d732dace8e273dd6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-chat 的功能「拖动排序」：拖动面板顶部的控制区域即可调整会话顺序；面板顺序由状态存储管理并持久化。 通过会话侧边栏、面板控件或设置卡片操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:506-720"]}
{"unit_id":"lanxiuyun__dsh-multi-chat#feature-3","repo":"lanxiuyun/dsh-multi-chat","commit":"8a7a96287c99dd3358d45301d732dace8e273dd6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-chat 的功能「面板管理」：可关闭非最后一个面板、只保留当前会话，并设置同时显示的面板数量；面板数默认上限为六，最大为九。 通过会话侧边栏、面板控件或设置卡片操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:506-517"]}
{"unit_id":"lanxiuyun__dsh-multi-chat#feature-4","repo":"lanxiuyun/dsh-multi-chat","commit":"8a7a96287c99dd3358d45301d732dace8e273dd6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-chat 的功能「网格开关」：可从设置卡片或工具栏关闭并重新开启并排网格；关闭时会恢复 DSH 原有单会话视图。 通过会话侧边栏、面板控件或设置卡片操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2102-2175"]}
